# Built-in Plugins Directory

This directory contains all built-in KPI plugins organized by domain.

## Directory Structure

- `processing-time/` - Plugins measuring time to first response, processing duration
- `turnaround/` - Plugins measuring full cycle time and turnaround metrics
- `throughput/` - Plugins measuring work completion rates and velocity
- `sla/` - Plugins measuring SLA compliance and target adherence
- `quality/` - Plugins measuring code quality, bug rates, rework
- `assignee/` - Plugins measuring individual and team performance

## Adding Built-in Plugins

1. Create plugin file in appropriate domain directory
2. Export default KpiPlugin object
3. Follow naming convention: `{metric}-plugin.ts`
4. Include metadata with description and examples

## Plugin Requirements

- Must implement KpiPlugin interface from `../../types.ts`
- Must have unique ID (kebab-case)
- Must specify domain and category
- Should include comprehensive metadata
